Z||000004||Seanh||03-29-2001||07:03 PM||||sometimes that procedure doesnt work. In PIP go to "HISTORY" and click the title of the picture you want to post and then the entire address of it's location will appear under "Clipboard Contents" go down, highlight it, and press Ctrl + "C". Then go into the reply and press ctrl + "V" and, if you want to post more then one pic, go back and click the title under the next picture you want to post, highlight it, copy and paste it.||||reg||1
