Z||000016||LT1 Chop Top||03-30-2001||05:43 PM||||I noticed several posts that stated that the chop top is too low to fit in.  I am about 6'2 1/2" and have absolutely no problem fitting.  Keep in mind that the seats are "chopped" too.  Archie had some custom seats put in there that is much thinner, but denser material (one inch or so less than stock).  They are VERY comfortable.  I fit in this one nearly as well as with my stock seats in my 88 GT.  Also, keep in mind that Archie is about 6'3" or so (I think), and he fit well too.||||reg||1
